{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇宙兄弟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は福岡でライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の公演を終えて\n夏のツアーも残すは\n神宮3日間です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月の深川さんの卒業コンサートから\n始まった今回のツアー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月のコンサートは\nアンダーのポジションで\nアンダーメンバーとして出ていましたが\n7月の大阪からは選抜メンバーとして\nこのツアーをまわっていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の初日から\n今日の公演を終えて\n私の中でいろんなことが変わって見えて\nいろいろなことを思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つも悔いはなく\n毎公演とにかくたのしかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっといろいろ感じて思って\n書きたいところだけど\n時間がせまってて書ききれないので\nまたかくねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短くてすみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたのサマーランドでの\nFMヨコハマさんの公開ラジオ収録\nお時間があれば来てくださいねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろな企画があるからおたのしみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩とひめちゃんよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に私の好きな角度のまいちゅんを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特別にみなさんにも見せてあげましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんがもぐもぐ\nかりんもぐもぐ\n